  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f0c45bcd9ab2af5458592fccc92a24c2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StatueDialog
  dialogBox: {fileID: 1458625741}
  DialogText: {fileID: 1684472852}
  playerInRange: 0
  possibleDialogs:
  - The plaque has worn away, but the farmers say this is Saint Elara, who calmed
    the earth's fury.
  - The hero depicted here was once a guardian of the 'Seven Keys.' Only six remain
    accounted for.
  - When the Veil of Sleep lifts, the stone will weep, and the forgotten gate shall
    answer.
  - The tears of stone mark the beginning of the end. Do not disturb what lies below.
  - Sir Reginald the Mediocre ^-^ He never beat the first dungeon but was very good
    at tidying up.
  - Oh, look. Another destined hero. Don't trip over the grass on your way to saving
    the world, kid.
  - The stone shall weep when a hero wears too much green. Avoid wearing a hat.
  - Only those with a flawless dental record may pass. You look like you chew rocks,
    so move on.
